(7363743, 1153150, 16912, '<td valign="top">ok, is a really road sign? - maybe and if so stolen (makes call)<br/>have I seen this type of shot before? - yes<br/>will it sway my vote? - no<br/>Can I see your chalk marks where you had to re draw the car - yes<br/>is your model laying on the ground - probably<br/>if this were a real car would the wheels turn? no way!<br/>and for me, the biggest issue is driving in those sandals! (at least it''s not 3" heels!<br/> <br/>That said my vote is a nine because it''s fun, a different take on the challenge and a few minutes respite from some rather boring shots.<br/> <br/>Now, if your in Hocus Focus I''ll be asking to change my vote!</td>', 'ok, is a really road sign? - maybe and if so stolen (makes call)have I seen this type of shot before? - yeswill it sway my vote? - noCan I see your chalk marks where you had to re draw the car - yesis your model laying on the ground - probablyif this were a real car would the wheels turn? no way!and for me, the biggest issue is driving in those sandals! (at least it''s not 3" heels! That said my vote is a nine because it''s fun, a different take on the challenge and a few minutes respite from some rather boring shots. Now, if your in Hocus Focus I''ll be asking to change my vote!', '2015-06-15 19:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
