(7363886, 1153766, 3936, '<td valign="top">Hopefully the folks from the other direction have a decent view up and down the track.  Nice exposure, unfortunately we do not get to pick the sky on the day we shoot.  Perhaps a different angle with less sky would help.</td>', 'Hopefully the folks from the other direction have a decent view up and down the track.  Nice exposure, unfortunately we do not get to pick the sky on the day we shoot.  Perhaps a different angle with less sky would help.', '2015-06-15 22:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
