(7363888, 1153853, 3936, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a speed trap in South Carolina.  They made a lot of money off the bushes.  I might have cropped a little off the left, to reduce competition with your subject.</td>', 'Reminds me of a speed trap in South Carolina.  They made a lot of money off the bushes.  I might have cropped a little off the left, to reduce competition with your subject.', '2015-06-15 22:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7363889, 1153619, 3936, '<td valign="top">I really like the processing in this image.  Colors are muted just enough to make sure attention goes to the sign.</td>', 'I really like the processing in this image.  Colors are muted just enough to make sure attention goes to the sign.', '2015-06-15 22:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7363893, 1153807, 3936, '<td valign="top">What a lonely little sign.  Seem redundant, in that it seem a bit obvious, but then that is your local road department at work.  Ours does the same.  I like the way the sign pops, without overdoing all the colors.</td>', 'What a lonely little sign.  Seem redundant, in that it seem a bit obvious, but then that is your local road department at work.  Ours does the same.  I like the way the sign pops, without overdoing all the colors.', '2015-06-15 22:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7363894, 1153804, 3936, '<td valign="top">Any chance this is Texas?  The only place I have ever seen "drive on" beaches. Very nice image, makes me wish I was there.</td>', 'Any chance this is Texas?  The only place I have ever seen "drive on" beaches. Very nice image, makes me wish I was there.', '2015-06-15 22:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7363895, 1153526, 3936, '<td valign="top">I may be metric challenged, but big trucks that fast on a really windy road?  I like the warm tones of your processing.</td>', 'I may be metric challenged, but big trucks that fast on a really windy road?  I like the warm tones of your processing.', '2015-06-15 22:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7363898, 1152454, 3936, '<td valign="top">I like the image, but it seems like there is a bit of a halo around the sign.  Especially the upper right.  The clou looks much lighter, than on the left side of the pole.</td>', 'I like the image, but it seems like there is a bit of a halo around the sign.  Especially the upper right.  The clou looks much lighter, than on the left side of the pole.', '2015-06-15 22:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7363899, 1153148, 3936, '<td valign="top">International symbol for Woodie on a Horse!  ;-). The pink flowers compete a bit for attention, but overall a beautiful landscape.</td>', 'International symbol for Woodie on a Horse!  ;-). The pink flowers compete a bit for attention, but overall a beautiful landscape.', '2015-06-15 22:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7363902, 1153818, 3936, '<td valign="top">The road may be less travelled, but it sure makes me want to go there.  Absolutely love the texture in the fence.  This would make a great poster!</td>', 'The road may be less travelled, but it sure makes me want to go there.  Absolutely love the texture in the fence.  This would make a great poster!', '2015-06-15 22:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7363903, 1153269, 34171, '<td valign="top">Nice blur on the car.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice blur on the car.  Well done.', '2015-06-15 22:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7363904, 1153716, 3936, '<td valign="top">I''m not usually one for selective desaturation.  It really works in this image!  This should be in a magazine.</td>', 'I''m not usually one for selective desaturation.  It really works in this image!  This should be in a magazine.', '2015-06-15 22:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7363905, 1153251, 34171, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2015-06-15 22:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7363907, 1153527, 34171, '<td valign="top">Lol, funny concept.</td>', 'Lol, funny concept.', '2015-06-15 22:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7363924, 1153716, 50864, '<td valign="top">This one is a puzzler for me. I believe it is the best photograph in the challenge. The  cloths hanging partially in the shadows are so perfect. The black and white processing with the totally black sky is lovely. The sign has great texture and the posters for abortions are heart wrenching. The puzzling part is why did you leave the color in the sign? I suppose it will score better with the colored sign but it is wrong :-) in my humble opinion.  Still a great photograph.</td>', 'This one is a puzzler for me. I believe it is the best photograph in the challenge. The  cloths hanging partially in the shadows are so perfect. The black and white processing with the totally black sky is lovely. The sign has great texture and the posters for abortions are heart wrenching. The puzzling part is why did you leave the color in the sign? I suppose it will score better with the colored sign but it is wrong :-) in my humble opinion.  Still a great photograph.', '2015-06-15 23:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7363925, 1153718, 50864, '<td valign="top">I like the oddness of this and very nice processing.</td>', 'I like the oddness of this and very nice processing.', '2015-06-15 23:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
