(7363999, 1152454, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the centered approach, but not as fond of the selective coloration/desaturation.  Would love to ride that bike path on the right.</td>', 'I like the centered approach, but not as fond of the selective coloration/desaturation.  Would love to ride that bike path on the right.', '2015-06-16 01:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
