(7364013, 1153076, 62249, '<td valign="top">While this meets the letter of the challenge topic, it''s not really in the spirit of the challenge. A lovely moody image. But kind of a shoehorn for the challenge.</td>', 'While this meets the letter of the challenge topic, it''s not really in the spirit of the challenge. A lovely moody image. But kind of a shoehorn for the challenge.', '2015-06-16 02:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364014, 1153823, 62249, '<td valign="top">The high-contrast, high-grain processing works well on this image, and the title helps pull it all together in a plausible story.</td>', 'The high-contrast, high-grain processing works well on this image, and the title helps pull it all together in a plausible story.', '2015-06-16 02:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364016, 1153853, 62249, '<td valign="top">The contrasty overhead light doesn''t do this shot any favors. The shadow it casts on the curving road sign detracts from the sign itself without adding any particular visual interest.</td>', 'The contrasty overhead light doesn''t do this shot any favors. The shadow it casts on the curving road sign detracts from the sign itself without adding any particular visual interest.', '2015-06-16 02:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364017, 1152620, 62249, '<td valign="top">Was this taken at Son Silver West? A good collection of signs, and the B/W processing is effective.</td>', 'Was this taken at Son Silver West? A good collection of signs, and the B/W processing is effective.', '2015-06-16 02:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364018, 1152935, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Nice set up.  Made me smile.</td>', 'Ha!  Nice set up.  Made me smile.', '2015-06-16 02:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364019, 1153677, 30982, '<td valign="top">So did you wait for someone to trip the camera or pay someone to get the ticket?  :-)</td>', 'So did you wait for someone to trip the camera or pay someone to get the ticket?  :-)', '2015-06-16 02:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364020, 1153714, 62249, '<td valign="top">The good: you used a low angle, blurred the signs, and converted to B/W to end up with something other than a normal (boring) head-on shot of signs. <br/> <br/>I think there''s too much dark pavement in the foreground and would perhaps like it better cropped up to where the white x''s begin.</td>', 'The good: you used a low angle, blurred the signs, and converted to B/W to end up with something other than a normal (boring) head-on shot of signs.  I think there''s too much dark pavement in the foreground and would perhaps like it better cropped up to where the white x''s begin.', '2015-06-16 02:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364021, 1152832, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great title - made me laugh!</td>', 'Great title - made me laugh!', '2015-06-16 02:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364022, 1152339, 30982, '<td valign="top">So gray and dreary.  But they walk with great purpose.</td>', 'So gray and dreary.  But they walk with great purpose.', '2015-06-16 02:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364024, 1153952, 62249, '<td valign="top">Heh, someone had a sense of humor.<br/> <br/>The blown out areas of highlights detract from the image, but the overall concept of making it look like a portal into hell (?) is good.</td>', 'Heh, someone had a sense of humor. The blown out areas of highlights detract from the image, but the overall concept of making it look like a portal into hell (?) is good.', '2015-06-16 02:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364025, 1152620, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great collection.  Reminds me of a place near where I lived in Texas.</td>', 'Great collection.  Reminds me of a place near where I lived in Texas.', '2015-06-16 02:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364027, 1152818, 30982, '<td valign="top">Now that''s an interesting sign....</td>', 'Now that''s an interesting sign....', '2015-06-16 02:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364028, 1153062, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha - don''t think I"ve ever seen a sign like that before.  Very lush scenery.</td>', 'Ha - don''t think I"ve ever seen a sign like that before.  Very lush scenery.', '2015-06-16 02:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364032, 1153849, 62249, '<td valign="top">Was this shot staged or a candid capture? The model''s foot closest to the skateboard disappears into the background. The road sign is relegated to bit player status because there''s so much other interesting stuff to look at. Still, I like the image well enough.</td>', 'Was this shot staged or a candid capture? The model''s foot closest to the skateboard disappears into the background. The road sign is relegated to bit player status because there''s so much other interesting stuff to look at. Still, I like the image well enough.', '2015-06-16 02:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364034, 1152817, 62249, '<td valign="top">Cute. Well exposed.</td>', 'Cute. Well exposed.', '2015-06-16 02:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364036, 1153978, 62249, '<td valign="top">A fun juxtaposition of the street name and the stop sign. There''s a lot going on in the image (stop sign, street name, tree top, power lines), and the harsh shadow on the top of the sign is also a distraction.</td>', 'A fun juxtaposition of the street name and the stop sign. There''s a lot going on in the image (stop sign, street name, tree top, power lines), and the harsh shadow on the top of the sign is also a distraction.', '2015-06-16 02:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364039, 1152935, 62249, '<td valign="top">I wonder whether the "Spot" fine gets applied to Rover and Fifi too, not just Spot. Well composed, well exposed, entertaining. Not technically a road sign in my book, but pretty close.</td>', 'I wonder whether the "Spot" fine gets applied to Rover and Fifi too, not just Spot. Well composed, well exposed, entertaining. Not technically a road sign in my book, but pretty close.', '2015-06-16 02:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364042, 1152620, 115814, '<td valign="top">I''m enjoying imagining the rest of the tableau outside the frame, and the numerous possibilities for context of this section of the big picture. Also appreciate the toning and processing choices. Nice.</td>', 'I''m enjoying imagining the rest of the tableau outside the frame, and the numerous possibilities for context of this section of the big picture. Also appreciate the toning and processing choices. Nice.', '2015-06-16 02:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364045, 1153570, 115814, '<td valign="top">Lots of emotion as the viewer.. Intrigue, curiosity, sadness, even embarrassment. I''m not a big fan of photos of people in crisis like this, but I want to understand the context. It''s both disturbing and compelling.</td>', 'Lots of emotion as the viewer.. Intrigue, curiosity, sadness, even embarrassment. I''m not a big fan of photos of people in crisis like this, but I want to understand the context. It''s both disturbing and compelling.', '2015-06-16 02:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364046, 1153358, 62249, '<td valign="top">I like the upper lights in addition to the tail light trails.</td>', 'I like the upper lights in addition to the tail light trails.', '2015-06-16 02:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364047, 1153407, 115814, '<td valign="top">Wow. I hope this was set up. Very moody. Evokes a combination of sadness and adventure.</td>', 'Wow. I hope this was set up. Very moody. Evokes a combination of sadness and adventure.', '2015-06-16 02:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364048, 1153236, 62249, '<td valign="top">The Golden Gate &amp; got are interesting. Image looks underexposed.</td>', 'The Golden Gate & got are interesting. Image looks underexposed.', '2015-06-16 02:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364049, 1153228, 62249, '<td valign="top">The processing makes this look like a composited shot.</td>', 'The processing makes this look like a composited shot.', '2015-06-16 02:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364051, 1153918, 62249, '<td valign="top">I get the attempt at (dark) humor, but the image itself doesn''t quite pull it off.</td>', 'I get the attempt at (dark) humor, but the image itself doesn''t quite pull it off.', '2015-06-16 02:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364052, 1153918, 115814, '<td valign="top">The title changes everything.</td>', 'The title changes everything.', '2015-06-16 02:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364053, 1153137, 115814, '<td valign="top">+ 1 for the title.</td>', '+ 1 for the title.', '2015-06-16 02:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364054, 1153537, 115814, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully processed to evoke the sense of bygone times.</td>', 'Wonderfully processed to evoke the sense of bygone times.', '2015-06-16 02:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364055, 1152948, 62249, '<td valign="top">Combining road signs and graveyards in a single shooting outing, eh? You''ve got some interesting elements in the scene, perhaps too many. The composition doesn''t direct my attention toward the sign. Instead, the leading lines of the road cause me to look at the tree, and then the bright hole in the sky. Then I notice the graves on the left. Eventually I get around to noticing the sign. A different vantage point or different crop could strengthen the image. Bet you''ve got a cool image in the Graveyard challenge.</td>', 'Combining road signs and graveyards in a single shooting outing, eh? You''ve got some interesting elements in the scene, perhaps too many. The composition doesn''t direct my attention toward the sign. Instead, the leading lines of the road cause me to look at the tree, and then the bright hole in the sky. Then I notice the graves on the left. Eventually I get around to noticing the sign. A different vantage point or different crop could strengthen the image. Bet you''ve got a cool image in the Graveyard challenge.', '2015-06-16 02:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364057, 1153807, 115814, '<td valign="top">Decisions, decisions. I hate it when that happens.</td>', 'Decisions, decisions. I hate it when that happens.', '2015-06-16 02:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364058, 1153844, 62249, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh out loud. Glad you did this in B/W.</td>', 'Made me laugh out loud. Glad you did this in B/W.', '2015-06-16 02:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364059, 1153692, 115814, '<td valign="top">The focal plane really creates and interesting effect and surprisingly effective isolation of the Maple sign as the central subject. Fascinating.</td>', 'The focal plane really creates and interesting effect and surprisingly effective isolation of the Maple sign as the central subject. Fascinating.', '2015-06-16 02:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364060, 1153238, 62249, '<td valign="top">This is a tricky lighting situation. Too bright on the snow, too dark to see much detail on the wood supports on the sign.</td>', 'This is a tricky lighting situation. Too bright on the snow, too dark to see much detail on the wood supports on the sign.', '2015-06-16 02:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364062, 1153283, 115814, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see a comma after STOP. Clever.</td>', 'I''d like to see a comma after STOP. Clever.', '2015-06-16 02:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364063, 1152438, 62249, '<td valign="top">Because the mountain is the brightest part of the image, my attention is drawn there first, and then to the headlights on the car. There''s very little light on the stacked signs below the main one, so they look pretty murky.</td>', 'Because the mountain is the brightest part of the image, my attention is drawn there first, and then to the headlights on the car. There''s very little light on the stacked signs below the main one, so they look pretty murky.', '2015-06-16 02:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364064, 1153452, 115814, '<td valign="top">Take me there. Now.</td>', 'Take me there. Now.', '2015-06-16 02:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364065, 1153786, 62249, '<td valign="top">Looks like the mother ship is about to beam up the cow.</td>', 'Looks like the mother ship is about to beam up the cow.', '2015-06-16 02:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364067, 1153574, 62249, '<td valign="top">Overprocessed. While the extra grainy look is okay in the clouds, it doesn''t work on the turn lane sign. Just makes the sign look scabby.</td>', 'Overprocessed. While the extra grainy look is okay in the clouds, it doesn''t work on the turn lane sign. Just makes the sign look scabby.', '2015-06-16 02:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364069, 1153269, 62249, '<td valign="top">Very cool blur!.</td>', 'Very cool blur!.', '2015-06-16 02:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364070, 1153831, 62249, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2015-06-16 02:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364071, 1152314, 113156, '<td valign="top">Some good processing and light here, an effective and strong photo and a 8 from me.</td>', 'Some good processing and light here, an effective and strong photo and a 8 from me.', '2015-06-16 03:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364074, 1152899, 113156, '<td valign="top">Superb slice of life street shot, i like everything about this so without further ado here is my very first be there blue award, you also get a 10 of course, thanks. <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1153614" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/113156/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153614.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/113156/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153614.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/113156/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153614.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Superb slice of life street shot, i like everything about this so without further ado here is my very first be there blue award, you also get a 10 of course, thanks. ', '2015-06-16 03:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364075, 1153786, 113156, '<td valign="top">A vision, this gets the first be there red award, wonderful.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1153615" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/113156/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153615.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/113156/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153615.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/113156/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153615.jpg"/></a></td>', 'A vision, this gets the first be there red award, wonderful.', '2015-06-16 03:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364082, 1153852, 6519, '<td valign="top">Nice. This is "outside the box", yet totally on topic. This is an angle we don''t often see, and that makes it interesting to view.</td>', 'Nice. This is "outside the box", yet totally on topic. This is an angle we don''t often see, and that makes it interesting to view.', '2015-06-16 03:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364085, 1153704, 6519, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but spelling errors just jump out at me, bite me on the nose and won''t let go, no matter how hard I try to ignore the pain.<br/> <br/>I make errors, too, in everyday chats, but I''d try very hard to get it right when it involves only three plus four words in a challenge image ... two mistakes in 7 words is two too many for me.</td>', 'Sorry, but spelling errors just jump out at me, bite me on the nose and won''t let go, no matter how hard I try to ignore the pain. I make errors, too, in everyday chats, but I''d try very hard to get it right when it involves only three plus four words in a challenge image ... two mistakes in 7 words is two too many for me.', '2015-06-16 04:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364087, 1153062, 115814, '<td valign="top">Terrific sign! I''m having a love-hate relationship with the processing, at once excessively stylized <u>and</u> reflective of the crisp colors and contrast of post-rain clarity.</td>', 'Terrific sign! I''m having a love-hate relationship with the processing, at once excessively stylized and reflective of the crisp colors and contrast of post-rain clarity.', '2015-06-16 04:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364088, 1153844, 115814, '<td valign="top"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Ministry_of_Silly_Walks#/media/File:Silly_Walk_Gait.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Instructions here</a>.</td>', 'Instructions here.', '2015-06-16 04:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364090, 1153157, 6519, '<td valign="top">Thank you so much for doing something above and beyond the obvious!! Nice shot, nice scenery, but you and your model really added to the scene.</td>', 'Thank you so much for doing something above and beyond the obvious!! Nice shot, nice scenery, but you and your model really added to the scene.', '2015-06-16 04:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364091, 1153745, 6519, '<td valign="top">I applaud your nice idea and your dedication. Good work!!!!</td>', 'I applaud your nice idea and your dedication. Good work!!!!', '2015-06-16 04:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364092, 1153150, 6519, '<td valign="top">I am sooo loving this!!! Can''t wait to see your notes on it!</td>', 'I am sooo loving this!!! Can''t wait to see your notes on it!', '2015-06-16 04:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364093, 1153507, 6519, '<td valign="top">I love how this is so chaotic, colourful, wild and ever so crisp! Nice camera/technical work!!!!!!</td>', 'I love how this is so chaotic, colourful, wild and ever so crisp! Nice camera/technical work!!!!!!', '2015-06-16 04:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364094, 1152843, 6519, '<td valign="top">Loving your composition, blur, etc.......</td>', 'Loving your composition, blur, etc.......', '2015-06-16 04:42:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7364095, 1152625, 6519, '<td valign="top">Fabulously messy! The contrast feels very..... ummm...... "contrasty" to me, but I still like it a lot.</td>', 'Fabulously messy! The contrast feels very..... ummm...... "contrasty" to me, but I still like it a lot.', '2015-06-16 04:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364096, 1153556, 6519, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of the image, and the crazy placement of that sign! A tad too sharp for my taste, but the overall concept wins my points, anyway.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of the image, and the crazy placement of that sign! A tad too sharp for my taste, but the overall concept wins my points, anyway.', '2015-06-16 04:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364122, 1152339, 113156, '<td valign="top">yes and this is one lovely photo, feels like i''m seeing reality through the little boys eyes, it also gets a 9 and my new be there yellow award.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1153616" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/113156/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153616.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/113156/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153616.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/113156/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153616.jpg"/></a></td>', 'yes and this is one lovely photo, feels like i''m seeing reality through the little boys eyes, it also gets a 9 and my new be there yellow award.', '2015-06-16 07:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364136, 1153269, 77196, '<td valign="top">Rather unusual juxtaposition of elements - rush hour with only one car in a very rural setting, sharp image with blurry car (nice capture, with semi-transparent vehicle). Lower angle. For me, the image is technically good, but there are too many messages and they are disjointed.</td>', 'Rather unusual juxtaposition of elements - rush hour with only one car in a very rural setting, sharp image with blurry car (nice capture, with semi-transparent vehicle). Lower angle. For me, the image is technically good, but there are too many messages and they are disjointed.', '2015-06-16 08:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364138, 1153619, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice tie-in of red newspaper box and red shirt. Somehow, it bothers me that the pedestrians on safely on the sidewalk, away from traffic, and walking away from the camera.</td>', 'Nice tie-in of red newspaper box and red shirt. Somehow, it bothers me that the pedestrians on safely on the sidewalk, away from traffic, and walking away from the camera.', '2015-06-16 08:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364140, 1153019, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting framing of the blurred lights. Perhaps a tad much of the overhead beam. I know that road signs was the challenge, but I find the RIGHT LANE ONLY sign distracting.</td>', 'Interesting framing of the blurred lights. Perhaps a tad much of the overhead beam. I know that road signs was the challenge, but I find the RIGHT LANE ONLY sign distracting.', '2015-06-16 09:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364141, 1153865, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice picture of the mountains. The sign is distracting, and a bit disturbing that it warns of a curve that is nowhere in sight. The difference in scale is also a bit disturbing - great big sign, itty bitty mountains.</td>', 'Nice picture of the mountains. The sign is distracting, and a bit disturbing that it warns of a curve that is nowhere in sight. The difference in scale is also a bit disturbing - great big sign, itty bitty mountains.', '2015-06-16 09:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364144, 1153935, 77196, '<td valign="top">Made me smile. The bush devouring the sign. Nice proportions. The sky, a large part of the image, is a bit bland and matches the sign color a bit too closely.</td>', 'Made me smile. The bush devouring the sign. Nice proportions. The sky, a large part of the image, is a bit bland and matches the sign color a bit too closely.', '2015-06-16 09:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364145, 1152700, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice color and perspective. The bird is a nice touch.</td>', 'Nice color and perspective. The bird is a nice touch.', '2015-06-16 09:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364146, 1152830, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting - it makes the picture.</td>', 'Nice lighting - it makes the picture.', '2015-06-16 09:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364151, 1153400, 77196, '<td valign="top">I''ve always wondered where the fast children play. Interesting concept. <br/>For me, this could have used a deeper depth of field, bringing the children into focus. Also, it isn''t clear what the children are doing. Were they just hit by a car? Are they playing in a puddle (which looks like it should drain away downhill)? I think you had additional context when taking the picture that doesn''t come across in the image itself.</td>', 'I''ve always wondered where the fast children play. Interesting concept. For me, this could have used a deeper depth of field, bringing the children into focus. Also, it isn''t clear what the children are doing. Were they just hit by a car? Are they playing in a puddle (which looks like it should drain away downhill)? I think you had additional context when taking the picture that doesn''t come across in the image itself.', '2015-06-16 09:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364154, 1153950, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice star effects light filter</td>', 'Nice star effects light filter', '2015-06-16 09:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364156, 1153452, 77196, '<td valign="top">I like the juxtaposition of the organic plant against the manufactured sign, and that they are at cross-angles, and that the organic is in focus, but the sign is not. To me, the image conveys a single, coherent message.</td>', 'I like the juxtaposition of the organic plant against the manufactured sign, and that they are at cross-angles, and that the organic is in focus, but the sign is not. To me, the image conveys a single, coherent message.', '2015-06-16 09:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364157, 1153150, 77196, '<td valign="top">I like the creativity of this. Just wondering who is missing their stop sign?</td>', 'I like the creativity of this. Just wondering who is missing their stop sign?', '2015-06-16 09:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364158, 1153896, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. IMO, it could have used a bit more lighting on the guy.</td>', 'Nice idea. IMO, it could have used a bit more lighting on the guy.', '2015-06-16 09:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364160, 1153376, 77196, '<td valign="top">Ah, a reflection on civilized madness!</td>', 'Ah, a reflection on civilized madness!', '2015-06-16 09:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364162, 1152818, 77196, '<td valign="top">I like the irony of a traffic sign saying NO TRAFFIC SIGNS.</td>', 'I like the irony of a traffic sign saying NO TRAFFIC SIGNS.', '2015-06-16 09:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364164, 1153607, 77196, '<td valign="top">Love the sign - great find. Looks like it has been there a while. Not sure I''m a fan of the 45 degree angle.</td>', 'Love the sign - great find. Looks like it has been there a while. Not sure I''m a fan of the 45 degree angle.', '2015-06-16 09:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364167, 1152514, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Interesting use of selective desat. A bit too centered for me - not sure what the big silver box on the right side adds to the image.</td>', 'Nice shot. Interesting use of selective desat. A bit too centered for me - not sure what the big silver box on the right side adds to the image.', '2015-06-16 09:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364168, 1153527, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice creativity. I think a closer match between the sign and the man carrying the white bar would make this a much stronger image.</td>', 'Nice creativity. I think a closer match between the sign and the man carrying the white bar would make this a much stronger image.', '2015-06-16 09:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364170, 1153076, 77196, '<td valign="top">Shoehorn, but very nicely done.</td>', 'Shoehorn, but very nicely done.', '2015-06-16 09:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364172, 1153947, 77196, '<td valign="top">Oh! I like covered bridges! This one is particularly interesting with the white beams and sides and double-row windows / openings. Looks like you''re fighting a bit of overexposure in the upper part of the shot.</td>', 'Oh! I like covered bridges! This one is particularly interesting with the white beams and sides and double-row windows / openings. Looks like you''re fighting a bit of overexposure in the upper part of the shot.', '2015-06-16 09:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364173, 1153789, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great lighting.</td>', 'Great lighting.', '2015-06-16 09:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364174, 1153769, 77196, '<td valign="top">Those creatures on the left do look like they''re creeping up!</td>', 'Those creatures on the left do look like they''re creeping up!', '2015-06-16 09:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364176, 1153932, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice find.</td>', 'Nice find.', '2015-06-16 09:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364178, 1153978, 77196, '<td valign="top">Think they used long enough bolts? Nice lighting and colors.</td>', 'Think they used long enough bolts? Nice lighting and colors.', '2015-06-16 09:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364180, 1153537, 77196, '<td valign="top">I like the clutter look of this.</td>', 'I like the clutter look of this.', '2015-06-16 09:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364184, 1152454, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting and use of selective desat. For me, bisecting the image with a slightly crooked pole just.... argh...</td>', 'Interesting lighting and use of selective desat. For me, bisecting the image with a slightly crooked pole just.... argh...', '2015-06-16 09:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364186, 1153555, 77196, '<td valign="top">Can''t say I''ve seen one of those before. What do they do with the drowsy drivers that die in 500m? Trade them? For what? Curious.</td>', 'Can''t say I''ve seen one of those before. What do they do with the drowsy drivers that die in 500m? Trade them? For what? Curious.', '2015-06-16 09:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364187, 1153834, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Not believable. Maybe a swim suit and a clean board...</td>', 'Nice idea. Not believable. Maybe a swim suit and a clean board...', '2015-06-16 09:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364220, 1153818, 114285, '<td valign="top">Funky tones, I like it!</td>', 'Funky tones, I like it!', '2015-06-16 10:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364298, 1153062, 156466, '<td valign="top">Love the composition but not the treatment</td>', 'Love the composition but not the treatment', '2015-06-16 12:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364301, 1153704, 156466, '<td valign="top">Spelling counts!!  Some of the "Lights" could have been pulled back a bit in this way, because it just doesn''t have me "Feelin'' That Way"</td>', 'Spelling counts!!  Some of the "Lights" could have been pulled back a bit in this way, because it just doesn''t have me "Feelin'' That Way"', '2015-06-16 12:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364303, 1153238, 156466, '<td valign="top">A lot of dynamic range in this shot with the lights and shadows.  Probably could/should have done a little more with it in post.</td>', 'A lot of dynamic range in this shot with the lights and shadows.  Probably could/should have done a little more with it in post.', '2015-06-16 12:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364306, 1152620, 156466, '<td valign="top">Left to cook just a little long.  Might have been more interesting in color.</td>', 'Left to cook just a little long.  Might have been more interesting in color.', '2015-06-16 12:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364308, 1153715, 156466, '<td valign="top">Would work for Rail Road Signs I</td>', 'Would work for Rail Road Signs I', '2015-06-16 12:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364309, 1152607, 156466, '<td valign="top">Frenetic</td>', 'Frenetic', '2015-06-16 12:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364312, 1153844, 156466, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this and need to know if you brought your own sign.  Not that it matters.</td>', 'I absolutely love this and need to know if you brought your own sign.  Not that it matters.', '2015-06-16 12:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364313, 1152832, 156466, '<td valign="top">Might have been better with some actual pedestrians?!</td>', 'Might have been better with some actual pedestrians?!', '2015-06-16 12:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364317, 1153957, 156466, '<td valign="top">Funny</td>', 'Funny', '2015-06-16 12:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364319, 1153574, 156466, '<td valign="top">Very effective</td>', 'Very effective', '2015-06-16 12:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364326, 1153103, 156466, '<td valign="top">Well seen.</td>', 'Well seen.', '2015-06-16 12:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364330, 1152620, 138630, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a lot of signs.  Looks like a collection and you have some very apt ones here.  Monochrome was a good choice - color would have distracted.</td>', 'Now that''s a lot of signs.  Looks like a collection and you have some very apt ones here.  Monochrome was a good choice - color would have distracted.', '2015-06-16 12:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364331, 1152817, 138630, '<td valign="top">I wanted something like this - deer crossing, moose crossing, goose crossing, anything crossing with the appropriate find.  Nice find.  Too bad, I think, about the Old Fall River Rd in the back - I don''t suppose you could have positioned yourself differently to bet the sign and horses and riders without it?</td>', 'I wanted something like this - deer crossing, moose crossing, goose crossing, anything crossing with the appropriate find.  Nice find.  Too bad, I think, about the Old Fall River Rd in the back - I don''t suppose you could have positioned yourself differently to bet the sign and horses and riders without it?', '2015-06-16 12:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364332, 1153790, 138630, '<td valign="top">Well, now, this is welcoming :)  That little Open sign is almost lost among all the dire warnings, isn''t it?</td>', 'Well, now, this is welcoming :)  That little Open sign is almost lost among all the dire warnings, isn''t it?', '2015-06-16 12:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364334, 1153283, 138630, '<td valign="top">May be set up but has a candid feel that I love.  I like the focus and color choices, too.  I do think she''s too orange but otherwise I like the reduced saturation look of the background.  Too bad there isn''t just a little aqua in the sky.</td>', 'May be set up but has a candid feel that I love.  I like the focus and color choices, too.  I do think she''s too orange but otherwise I like the reduced saturation look of the background.  Too bad there isn''t just a little aqua in the sky.', '2015-06-16 12:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364339, 1153789, 138630, '<td valign="top">Lots going on here.  It''s over-processed for my taste but interesting to explore.</td>', 'Lots going on here.  It''s over-processed for my taste but interesting to explore.', '2015-06-16 12:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364342, 1153358, 138630, '<td valign="top">Not quite through but this is about the best light trail image I''ve seen.  The trails fill the frame nicely without being too much and the relatively simple palette helps a lot.</td>', 'Not quite through but this is about the best light trail image I''ve seen.  The trails fill the frame nicely without being too much and the relatively simple palette helps a lot.', '2015-06-16 12:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364343, 1153532, 138630, '<td valign="top">Are you serious?  This is very funny.  I didn''t even know they could read!</td>', 'Are you serious?  This is very funny.  I didn''t even know they could read!', '2015-06-16 12:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364345, 1153076, 53147, '<td valign="top">So many images to sift through in this challenge. So many similar uninspired images that surely meet the challenge but reach for nothing else. And then there is this. This is lovely. Simply lovely. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=649858" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53147/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_649858.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53147/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_649858.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53147/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_649858.jpg"/></a></td>', 'So many images to sift through in this challenge. So many similar uninspired images that surely meet the challenge but reach for nothing else. And then there is this. This is lovely. Simply lovely. ', '2015-06-16 12:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364346, 1153823, 53147, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot. Love the dark and gritty feel to it. Feels good on my eyes. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=649859" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53147/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_649859.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53147/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_649859.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53147/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_649859.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I like this image a lot. Love the dark and gritty feel to it. Feels good on my eyes. ', '2015-06-16 12:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364348, 1153400, 53147, '<td valign="top">This image brought a smile to my face and kept me hanging on it to smile a while longer. I was having a hard time getting through and voting on all of the images. Almost blew off the last twenty or so because the challenge was a bit numbing. So glad I finished it out as this was in the last handful to come up. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=649860" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53147/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_649860.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53147/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_649860.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53147/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_649860.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This image brought a smile to my face and kept me hanging on it to smile a while longer. I was having a hard time getting through and voting on all of the images. Almost blew off the last twenty or so because the challenge was a bit numbing. So glad I finished it out as this was in the last handful to come up. ', '2015-06-16 12:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364372, 1153527, 100831, '<td valign="top">Fabulouso!  A tribute to the challenge. Made me giggle. 8</td>', 'Fabulouso!  A tribute to the challenge. Made me giggle. 8', '2015-06-16 13:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364374, 1153844, 100831, '<td valign="top">Oh my! Love it!</td>', 'Oh my! Love it!', '2015-06-16 13:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364384, 1152818, 100831, '<td valign="top">None indeed</td>', 'None indeed', '2015-06-16 13:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364388, 1153984, 47974, '<td valign="top">I am taking part in the "Comment on the first 10 photos during voting" challenge and you are photo #5<br/> <br/>Really great image and conversion.  The composition is good and the clouds really add to the sky (sucker for pretty white clouds).  Only thing I can see that would have made it a bit stronger is if you had done some dodging on the sign to brighten it up just a bit.</td>', 'I am taking part in the "Comment on the first 10 photos during voting" challenge and you are photo #5 Really great image and conversion.  The composition is good and the clouds really add to the sky (sucker for pretty white clouds).  Only thing I can see that would have made it a bit stronger is if you had done some dodging on the sign to brighten it up just a bit.', '2015-06-16 13:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364389, 1153714, 47974, '<td valign="top">I am taking part in the "Comment on the first 10 photos during voting" challenge and you are photo #7<br/> <br/>Love this photograph.  Love the lines on the road that provide some kind of notification to the drivers and that you chose to blur out the background signs. The conversion is perfect and I like how you offset the line running across the road.  Great job overall.</td>', 'I am taking part in the "Comment on the first 10 photos during voting" challenge and you are photo #7 Love this photograph.  Love the lines on the road that provide some kind of notification to the drivers and that you chose to blur out the background signs. The conversion is perfect and I like how you offset the line running across the road.  Great job overall.', '2015-06-16 13:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7364390, 1153896, 47974, '<td valign="top">I am taking part in the "Comment on the first 10 photos during voting" challenge and you are photo #10<br/> <br/>Really great take on the challenge.  Love the conversion and the composition is spot on.  Love that nothing behind the sign is visible, leaves you wondering why is the road closed.  Including a person really makes the image much stronger, not sure it would be nearly as good with him.  My only critique is that small thing to the left of the sign that is visible, I would have removed it.</td>', 'I am taking part in the "Comment on the first 10 photos during voting" challenge and you are photo #10 Really great take on the challenge.  Love the conversion and the composition is spot on.  Love that nothing behind the sign is visible, leaves you wondering why is the road closed.  Including a person really makes the image much stronger, not sure it would be nearly as good with him.  My only critique is that small thing to the left of the sign that is visible, I would have removed it.', '2015-06-16 13:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
