(7365234, 1153662, 62249, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a grim scoreboard. A bit too contrasty.</td>', 'Now that''s a grim scoreboard. A bit too contrasty.', '2015-06-17 01:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365238, 1153508, 62249, '<td valign="top">I''ve been there. Ate a burger at Kua ''Aina. Cool sign.</td>', 'I''ve been there. Ate a burger at Kua ''Aina. Cool sign.', '2015-06-17 02:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365316, 1153959, 149964, '<td valign="top">Clever way of ''framing'' a sign in the rays.</td>', 'Clever way of ''framing'' a sign in the rays.', '2015-06-17 03:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365318, 1153978, 149964, '<td valign="top">Not sure if intentional or not but am reading this as ''Nae Going Street'' which is just perfect with the stop sign!</td>', 'Not sure if intentional or not but am reading this as ''Nae Going Street'' which is just perfect with the stop sign!', '2015-06-17 03:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365329, 1153371, 67258, '<td valign="top">Lovely!</td>', 'Lovely!', '2015-06-17 05:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365331, 1153844, 67258, '<td valign="top">Bumping to 9 - among my top 3.</td>', 'Bumping to 9 - among my top 3.', '2015-06-17 05:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365570, 1153935, 21905, '<td valign="top">hilarious!</td>', 'hilarious!', '2015-06-17 10:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365699, 1153376, 30364, '<td valign="top">Bewitchingly lovely.  I''d have been thrilled beyond measure to have taken this photograph.  It''s so perfectly, elegantly balanced between complexity and simplicity.  It''s wonderful.  It''s a shared Yellow Thumb for you, and a 9 and my thank you for elevating this challenge with some imagination and art.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1147147" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1147147.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1147147.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1147147.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Bewitchingly lovely.  I''d have been thrilled beyond measure to have taken this photograph.  It''s so perfectly, elegantly balanced between complexity and simplicity.  It''s wonderful.  It''s a shared Yellow Thumb for you, and a 9 and my thank you for elevating this challenge with some imagination and art.', '2015-06-17 12:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365701, 1153945, 30364, '<td valign="top">Love this.  Sparkling sharp photography, and I do not refer to focus.  It''s a shared Yellow Thumb for you, plus a 9 and a thank you.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1147147" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1147147.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1147147.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1147147.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Love this.  Sparkling sharp photography, and I do not refer to focus.  It''s a shared Yellow Thumb for you, plus a 9 and a thank you.', '2015-06-17 12:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365702, 1152314, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is unexpected, and wonderfully so.  Mad hair.  But this is also a wonderful demonstration of how to overcome a deathly dull challenge topic with imagination and flair.  I hope all the people who punted will look at this and learn something.  Faint hope, I suppose.  Red Thumb for you, and a 10 and my thank you for this interesting photograph.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1147146" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1147146.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1147146.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1147146.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This is unexpected, and wonderfully so.  Mad hair.  But this is also a wonderful demonstration of how to overcome a deathly dull challenge topic with imagination and flair.  I hope all the people who punted will look at this and learn something.  Faint hope, I suppose.  Red Thumb for you, and a 10 and my thank you for this interesting photograph.', '2015-06-17 12:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365703, 1153076, 30364, '<td valign="top">Thank Goodness for you.  I was voting in deep and increasing despair, and going down for the last time until you came along and threw this lifeline.  Blue Thumb (shared), 10 and thank you.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1147145" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1147145.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1147145.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1147145.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Thank Goodness for you.  I was voting in deep and increasing despair, and going down for the last time until you came along and threw this lifeline.  Blue Thumb (shared), 10 and thank you.', '2015-06-17 12:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365777, 1153844, 16046, '<td valign="top">Best in show award, congrats</td>', 'Best in show award, congrats', '2015-06-17 13:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365779, 1153745, 16046, '<td valign="top">Top 2</td>', 'Top 2', '2015-06-17 13:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365781, 1153932, 16046, '<td valign="top">Top 3</td>', 'Top 3', '2015-06-17 13:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7365908, 1153716, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''m biased because I live here and have seen these desperately sad signs many times.  But my bias aside, this is still a terrific photograph of the crushing weight of dismal reality that descends on African women, whether they like it or not.  Most people won''t get this part, but you have suggested the burden borne upon the head, and that''s brilliant.  I prefer to think that you intended it, so there.  Beautiful, awful (literally) photograph that rises far above the formulaic rubbish that seems to have characterised this challenge.  10 and a shared Blue Thumb for you, and Ndiyabulela Enkosi.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1147145" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1147145.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1147145.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1147145.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I''m biased because I live here and have seen these desperately sad signs many times.  But my bias aside, this is still a terrific photograph of the crushing weight of dismal reality that descends on African women, whether they like it or not.  Most people won''t get this part, but you have suggested the burden borne upon the head, and that''s brilliant.  I prefer to think that you intended it, so there.  Beautiful, awful (literally) photograph that rises far above the formulaic rubbish that seems to have characterised this challenge.  10 and a shared Blue Thumb for you, and Ndiyabulela Enkosi.', '2015-06-17 16:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7366097, 1153238, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great location and sign ... too bad you lost the background. Next time, maybe HDR would  help.</td>', 'Great location and sign ... too bad you lost the background. Next time, maybe HDR would  help.', '2015-06-17 23:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7366155, 1152514, 83149, '<td valign="top">I like it, nice detail all over, but I am not sold on the colour in the sign.</td>', 'I like it, nice detail all over, but I am not sold on the colour in the sign.', '2015-06-18 02:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7366156, 1153452, 83149, '<td valign="top">Nice take to make an otherwise boring subject more interesting.  I am not a fan of the small image size though.</td>', 'Nice take to make an otherwise boring subject more interesting.  I am not a fan of the small image size though.', '2015-06-18 02:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7366160, 1153062, 83149, '<td valign="top">I like the colours and the composition, but it looks over processed to me.  Good choice to keep the sign as a less significant feature. <br/> <br/>I am also wondering how you can actually accomplish the skid marks showing on the sign, looks like some laws of physics were broken.  8-)</td>', 'I like the colours and the composition, but it looks over processed to me.  Good choice to keep the sign as a less significant feature.  I am also wondering how you can actually accomplish the skid marks showing on the sign, looks like some laws of physics were broken.  8-)', '2015-06-18 02:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
