(7368875, 1153861, 49954, '<td valign="top">For me the implication of Road Sign is that there is a traffic or highway sign (official).  In this case, you have a great on in the tractor crossing sign, but it''s not prominent.</td>', 'For me the implication of Road Sign is that there is a traffic or highway sign (official).  In this case, you have a great on in the tractor crossing sign, but it''s not prominent.', '2015-06-22 00:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
