(7368881, 1153423, 49954, '<td valign="top">Were it not for the microscopic speed limit sign, this would not meet the challenge.  The other signs are advertising signs, not "road signs" per the spirit of the challenge.  Regardless, you squeaked it in.  Cute...</td>', 'Were it not for the microscopic speed limit sign, this would not meet the challenge.  The other signs are advertising signs, not "road signs" per the spirit of the challenge.  Regardless, you squeaked it in.  Cute...', '2015-06-22 00:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
