(7369296, 1152739, 77196, '<td valign="top">This image has been awarded the Brunette pigtail award. <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1153373" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77196/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153373.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77196/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153373.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77196/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153373.gif"/></a> <br/>It speaks to me of times past, values from yesteryear, sacrifices of pioneers, people who worked the land to feed their families, horse-drawn wagons, and perhaps even of a young couple''s stroll as they were going to and fro. <br/>It is tranquil - a peaceful crossing, with the water gurgling gently beneath - uninterrupted by the hurry and scurry of modern life. <br/>Congratulations!<br/></td>', 'This image has been awarded the Brunette pigtail award.  It speaks to me of times past, values from yesteryear, sacrifices of pioneers, people who worked the land to feed their families, horse-drawn wagons, and perhaps even of a young couple''s stroll as they were going to and fro. It is tranquil - a peaceful crossing, with the water gurgling gently beneath - uninterrupted by the hurry and scurry of modern life. Congratulations!', '2015-06-22 09:04:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7369300, 1153452, 77196, '<td valign="top">This image has been awarded the Geriatric pigtail award. <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1153375" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77196/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153375.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77196/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153375.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77196/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153375.gif"/></a> <br/>I came across your image early in the voting, so I was able to comment on it then. After voting on all the images, yours still stood out from the crowd. It has that certain something that speaks beyond the photograph, and hints at deeper meanings. No distractions. Very nice.<br/>Congratulations!<br/></td>', 'This image has been awarded the Geriatric pigtail award.  I came across your image early in the voting, so I was able to comment on it then. After voting on all the images, yours still stood out from the crowd. It has that certain something that speaks beyond the photograph, and hints at deeper meanings. No distractions. Very nice.Congratulations!', '2015-06-22 09:09:05.000000', NULL, 0),
