(7370072, 1152818, 69668, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully done!!! Congrats Ursula!!</td>', 'Wonderfully done!!! Congrats Ursula!!', '2015-06-22 23:44:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(7370157, 1153918, 119419, '<td valign="top">Nice to see you again</td>', 'Nice to see you again', '2015-06-23 01:42:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7370179, 1153371, 101117, '<td valign="top">Had to be Scotland with those unique colours!<br/> <br/>Nicely captured, though I think perhaps a little heavy handed on the contrast / burn in the top third of the image.</td>', 'Had to be Scotland with those unique colours! Nicely captured, though I think perhaps a little heavy handed on the contrast / burn in the top third of the image.', '2015-06-23 02:41:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7370225, 1153269, 147314, '<td valign="top">The sign and scenery told me it was Scotland. But where? I even thought it might be on my ''own'' Isle of Skye. But Mull is a good alternative, maybe even one of the most beautiful islands of Scotland.<br/>Great image, I really like the movement of the car and this curved movement and the similar curves in clouds and road really makes this a strong image. Congrats on the HM!</td>', 'The sign and scenery told me it was Scotland. But where? I even thought it might be on my ''own'' Isle of Skye. But Mull is a good alternative, maybe even one of the most beautiful islands of Scotland.Great image, I really like the movement of the car and this curved movement and the similar curves in clouds and road really makes this a strong image. Congrats on the HM!', '2015-06-23 07:03:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(7370226, 1152968, 147314, '<td valign="top">Amazing scenery, one of those countries I really hope to visit one day. Congrats on the HM!</td>', 'Amazing scenery, one of those countries I really hope to visit one day. Congrats on the HM!', '2015-06-23 07:04:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7370437, 1153844, 12253, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  Congratulations!</td>', 'Excellent!  Congratulations!', '2015-06-23 13:12:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(7370458, 1153716, 68504, '<td valign="top">I gave you a high score, maybe not high enough. I found this painful to contemplate, very in keeping with your processing (and shooting) choices.</td>', 'I gave you a high score, maybe not high enough. I found this painful to contemplate, very in keeping with your processing (and shooting) choices.', '2015-06-23 13:35:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7370465, 1153959, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club....<br/> <br/>1st of all I will say that I have to disagree with the DNMC comment below. I don''t see why this would not match the challenge. Now on to the pic. The lighting, even though it is very important for this shot was also a negative for me. It has hurt the overall shot due to the lack of detail towards the bottom of the shot. However, that being said the sky I love. It almost has a 3d look to it. What can I say....I''m a sucker for angry clouds. <br/> <br/>On the lighting....I wonder if a filter and maybe a slightly longer shutter would have helped it out. Might be worth experimenting with. Happy shooting</td>', 'Hello from the critique club.... 1st of all I will say that I have to disagree with the DNMC comment below. I don''t see why this would not match the challenge. Now on to the pic. The lighting, even though it is very important for this shot was also a negative for me. It has hurt the overall shot due to the lack of detail towards the bottom of the shot. However, that being said the sky I love. It almost has a 3d look to it. What can I say....I''m a sucker for angry clouds.  On the lighting....I wonder if a filter and maybe a slightly longer shutter would have helped it out. Might be worth experimenting with. Happy shooting', '2015-06-23 13:43:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7370471, 1153952, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>1st thing that caught my eye was not the pic itself....it was the street names on the signs. You could not have asked for a better combination of names. It gave me a little chuckle. As far as the shot itself....There are a few blown areas that are a bit distracting. The sun can sometimes play havoc. I do like the "dust storm" effect. It feels like it''s from an old mining town in Utah. I also think the clouds are interesting. Happy shooting</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... 1st thing that caught my eye was not the pic itself....it was the street names on the signs. You could not have asked for a better combination of names. It gave me a little chuckle. As far as the shot itself....There are a few blown areas that are a bit distracting. The sun can sometimes play havoc. I do like the "dust storm" effect. It feels like it''s from an old mining town in Utah. I also think the clouds are interesting. Happy shooting', '2015-06-23 13:55:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7370527, 1152819, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>Janine....Overall nice shot. Nice fluffy clouds. The sign is very crisp and clean looking. However the shot is missing something. Where are the bullet holes??? A sign like that in Louisiana would have at least 3 or 4 bullet holes in it. It''s good target practice. Nice shot though. Keep it up. Happy shooting</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... Janine....Overall nice shot. Nice fluffy clouds. The sign is very crisp and clean looking. However the shot is missing something. Where are the bullet holes??? A sign like that in Louisiana would have at least 3 or 4 bullet holes in it. It''s good target practice. Nice shot though. Keep it up. Happy shooting', '2015-06-23 14:58:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7370614, 1152631, 96751, '<td valign="top">What a fun find</td>', 'What a fun find', '2015-06-23 16:51:17.000000', NULL, 0),
